---
layout: workspace.njk
title: Component examples
screen: examples
subtitle: Working sample controls from caswow.library
---
<div class="row g-3">
<div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
<section class="card bg-body h-100">
<div class="card-body">
<h2 class="h5">Project preferences</h2>
<p class="text-body-secondary">Try the library’s form controls. This example stays on this page and does not change project records.</p>
<form data-sample-form>
<div class="mb-3">
<label class="form-label" for="example-name">Display name</label>
<input class="form-control " id="example-name" name="displayName" required maxlength="80" value="N819 project review">
</div>
<div class="mb-3">
<label class="form-label" for="example-view">Default view</label>
<select class="form-select" id="example-view" name="view">
<option>Financial summary</option>
<option>Project hours</option>
<option>Drawing register</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="mb-3">
<label class="form-label" for="example-notes">Review notes</label>
<textarea class="form-control" id="example-notes" name="notes" rows="3" maxlength="500" aria-describedby="example-help">
</textarea>
<p id="example-help" class="small text-body-secondary">Sample notes only. Changes are not saved after reloading.</p>
</div>
<button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Apply sample preferences</button>
<p class="mt-3 mb-0" role="status" data-form-result>
</p>
</form>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
<section class="card bg-body h-100">
<div class="card-body">
<h2 class="h5">Library patterns in use</h2>
<ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
<li class="list-group-item">Page headers and navigation</li>
<li class="list-group-item">Cards and neutral badges <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">Sample</span>
</li>
<li class="list-group-item">Labeled inputs and selects</li>
<li class="list-group-item">Accessible progress values</li>
<li class="list-group-item">Theme-aware colors and focus</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="h6 mt-4">Explore a sample workflow</h3>
<a href="{{ '/plans/' | url }}">Preview a drawing</a>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</div>
